{"title":"Indiana mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Indiana_Middle_School_Mathematics_Competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Indiana Middle School Mathematics Competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Indiana_High_School_Mathematics_Competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Indiana High School Mathematics Competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#National_Math_Contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National Math Contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Indiana_Middle_School_Mathematics_Competitions\">Indiana Middle School Mathematics Competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indiana_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Indiana Middle School Mathematics Competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indiana_MathCounts\" title=\"Indiana MathCounts\">Indiana MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indiana_State_Mathematics_Contest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Indiana State Mathematics Contest\">Indiana State Mathematics Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.iun.edu/%7Emathst/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Huntington_University_Middle_Grades_Math_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Huntington University Middle Grades Math Competition (page does not exist)\">Huntington University Middle Grades Math Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.huntington.edu/math/competition/default.htm\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Indiana_High_School_Mathematics_Competitions\">Indiana High School Mathematics Competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indiana_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Indiana High School Mathematics Competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Franklin_College_Math_Day&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Franklin College Math Day (page does not exist)\">Franklin College Math Day</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.franklincollege.edu/matweb/mathday.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Huntington_University_High_School_Mathematics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Huntington University High School Mathematics Competition (page does not exist)\">Huntington University High School Mathematics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.huntington.edu/math/Competition/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indiana_State_Mathematics_Contest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Indiana State Mathematics Contest\">Indiana State Mathematics Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.iun.edu/%7Emathst/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IUPUI_High_School_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"IUPUI High School Math Contest (page does not exist)\">IUPUI High School Math Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.iupui.edu/news/contest/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rose-Hulman_High_School_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Rose-Hulman High School Math Contest (page does not exist)\">Rose-Hulman High School Math Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.rose-hulman.edu/%7Erickert/NovContest/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TriState_University_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"TriState University Math Contest (page does not exist)\">TriState University Math Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.tristate.edu/dept/mathcs/events.htm\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_Math_Contests\">National Math Contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indiana_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National Math Contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indiana_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c300_indiana\">Indiana forum on AoPS</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018091158\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage